  "note": "One entry per meeting, holding every record that could plausibly be the subject of that call plus the SIGNALS that tie them. Claude gathers the signals; diff.py decides confident vs ambiguous vs unmatched. The decision is deterministic on purpose — a wrong match is the most expensive mistake this plugin can make.",
  "signal_vocabulary": {
    "crm_link": "the transcript source itself carried a CRM record id",
    "calendar_event": "the calendar invite for this meeting is linked to the record",
